runtime/probe/runtime/
*.ipa
*.deb
# Signing files never belong in this repo; keep them in ~/.accretion-signing
*.p12
*.mobileprovision
*.pem
__pycache__/
.upload-key

# assistant files (kept in the private handbook)
CLAUDE.md
CLAUDE.local.md
AGENTS.md
REPLICATE.md
PRIVATE.md

# aider (Mod Studio) keeps its chat history here
.aider*
Tweak.hidden.x
AMTweaks.gen.h
AMTweaks.gen.m
AMDetectionProfile.gen.h
